This repository contains the paper-era ContainerSim simulator and the archived
result metrics used for the UCC 2021 paper "Enforcing Deployment Latency SLA in
Edge Infrastructures through Multi-objective Genetic Scheduler."

The simulation code is derived from ContainerSim. See ERRATA.md for the
compatibility changes and the differences between the archived and published
results. The original run reports are available on the main branch.
